// (rz/RZCOMDllDirectorShape.h), built in place by our getters (the _Get entries, GetCOMDirector) and the MadCow
// initialiser; every creation site of the game calls one of those (or a constructor hooked here), so every director
// carries our vtables. The other entries are adapters (old entry points: direct calls, and objects with game vtables).
// Bisect switch: the getters, GetCOMDirector, the constructors and InitMadCow together (with those off the game builds
// its own directors and the adapters serve them). The audio director (cTSAudioCOMDirector) is still hook-shaped.
// Lane GP: 23 OnStart / deleting-destructor / hooks-face slots that only the game's vtables reach have no entry; each is
// trapped under its director's one creating hook (Hooks.COMDirectors_<name>_Construct or _Get=1, "in_effect": "callers").
// Lane GT: the 15 whose check rests on two hooks (constructor and destructor body, or constructor and getter) have no entry
// either; their traps are the conjunction ("Hooks.COMDirectors_<name>_Construct=1&Hooks.COMDirectors_<name>_DestructorBody=1").
// The byte matches keep their adapter.

